{
  "body" : "You are designing a soft, sketch-style anime illustration.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Main character or figure: {{character}}\n- Background or setting: {{setting}}\n- Additional constraints: {{extra}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: Sketch-style anime illustration\n- Composition: Centered figure on a minimal backdrop with balanced negative space\n- Lens / camera: None (2D illustration without perspective distortion)\n- Lighting: Soft and indirect, with flat shading and a pastel-like softness\n- Color palette and grading: Muted pastel tones (pinks, blues, and whites) with gentle color contrasts and a desaturated aesthetic\n- Texture / surface: Hand-drawn pencil or crayon texture with visible strokes and rough edges\n- Post-processing: Minimal, with a clean, airy finish and subtle doodle-like elements\n- Mood: Dreamy, serene, whimsical\n- References: Studio Ghibli sketches, light indie manga, whimsical anime art styles\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 4:3 landscape (~1024×768) suitable for character-focused illustrations\n- Maintain a balance of simplicity and detail, ensuring the central figure remains the focal point\n- Use soft, flowing lines and avoid overly rigid or geometric elements\n- Include the signature \"{{signature}}\" as a small, natural handwritten artist signature\n- The signature should look like a genuine handwritten mark, not typed text or a title\n- Place the signature subtly in an unobtrusive area, preferably near the bottom corner\n\nAVOID\n- Harsh or overly vibrant colors\n- Complex or overly busy backgrounds\n- Realistic rendering or sharp edges\n- Heavy shading or intricate lighting effects\n- Overuse of fine detail that detracts from a soft aesthetic\n- Large, prominent, or decorative typography\n- Treating the signature as a title, caption, or regular printed text\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nMain character or figure: {{character}}\nBackground or setting: {{setting}}\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\nHandwritten signature: {{signature}}",
